# SQL DATE ends at 9999-12-31; TIMESTAMP bounds apply to UTC instants.
# INTERVAL overflow is an error; other paths retain their existing clamp policy.
# Use STRING output for boundary timestamps to avoid the client's narrower Jiff range.

statement ok
